  "limitations": [
    "One ended synthetic meeting, no pagination or mutation state. Exact meeting ID and integer elapsed duration are verified independently from start/end timestamps; this does not evaluate live behavior or recipient authorization.",
    "Only a successful meeting_record signed read satisfies required_reads. user_info and recording_supplement do not satisfy it. The recording route exists solely to accommodate the existing vc +detail supplemental lookup; recording duration is not proof of meeting elapsed duration.",
    "query_mode is limited to omitted/0: artifact-only query_mode=1 is outside the task and rejected. with_participants omitted/false returns no participant collection; explicit true uses tested participant shapes with distinct synthetic open/user/union identifiers. Invalid known selector values are rejected; unrelated query keys remain allowed by the common static table.",
    "with_meeting_ability=true is unsupported by this static fixture: the real API returns ability only for bot identity, and FORMAT v1 cannot select a response by signed identity header. Both user and bot metadata reads with that option omitted/false remain supported. An identity selector would be required to model optional ability statistics faithfully; it is not needed for the elapsed-duration task.",
    "No response data or expected values are present in the model-facing output schema. CLI examples use existing public syntax, previously covered by VC process tests and tests/next_foundation/fixture_e2e_test.go. The evaluator must still run its controlled binary tests before marking this runtime table executable.",
    "No model runs, live calls, server/product edits or staging/commits were performed to author this normalized JSON."
